      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "INFRASONIC (2) took the sit on the lead from a low draw but levelled up and led around the bend to score (22.04) at this track in a Grade 5 over 380m. Will go close again if runs up to latest. BOMB LUCA (4) ran a good time (30.27) when placing three back at Mt Gambier but has missed the frame since, last time out finishing sixth (22.57) at this track. Can feature with the right run. ZERO FORGING (6) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fifth (22.26) in a Grade 5 at this track. Goes well out of this box with a win and three minor placings. One of the better hopes. SUNSET BOY (1) was unplaced here last start but gets his chance to atone.",
